// ═══════════════════════════ i18n ═══════════════════════════
// A real translation system: a key -> string dictionary per language,
// a safe lookup function (falls back to English, then to the raw key
// itself, so a missing translation never shows blank or breaks), and
// persistence so a person doesn't have to reselect their language every
// visit. Deliberately NOT machine-translating text live — that reads as
// obviously artificial; every string below is a real, deliberate
// translation. Arabic gets real RTL support (document direction flips),
// not just translated text sitting in a left-to-right layout.
// Real category-name translations — previously category names (Plumbing,
// Cleaning, etc.) never translated at all, regardless of language
// selected, since they're admin-managed content pulled live from the
// database, not static page text. This is a curated, hand-checked map
// covering every category this app ships with today (src/seed.js) — an
// admin adding a genuinely NEW category later falls back to showing its
// English name until a translation is added here, rather than showing
// nothing or breaking. These are AI-produced translations, not reviewed
// by a native speaker of each language yet — worth a real review pass
// before fully relying on them, especially for Arabic and Chinese.
